      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FLIGHTS BOOKED (7) was speedy out of box 3 on debut to score by 3.5 lengths (16.52) at this track over 300m. Boxed wide but has the pace to be prominent. Can make it back to back wins. Can continue winning ways. KATIE CUDDLES (1) comes off an average effort last start when eighth at this track over 350m behind Gypsy Moss (20.00) in a Grade 6. Placed at her previous run. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. CUSTARD (2) dropped out early but hit the line hard, charging into third and beaten 8 lengths win (20.42) at Q Lakeside in Grade 6. The form from her last run stacks up well. Nicely placed to grab a well-deserved win. JIMARY BUTTERFLY (3) will need to run right up to last start to feature again.",
